	"bodyHtml": "<div class=\"d--flex\" style=\"flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n                    \n\n                                        \n                            <div id=\"id-34-79\" class=\"section section__textblock section--none section--padding bg-c--hard-conversion txt-c--nero title-c--nero link-c--nero\">\n      <div class=\"san-container\" data-span=\"full-desktop\">\n                    <div class=\"san-col\" data-span=\"12 desktop-xl-6\">\n        <div class=\"j-content txt--left pb--0 desktop-xl-pb--60\" data-block=\"\" data-type=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"text\">\n          <h1>HMMM...CAT SOUPS<br>WITH FINE PIECES OF<br>MEAT AND FISH</h1>\n\n                </div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n\n  <div class=\"san-col\" data-span=\"12 desktop-xl-6\">\n          <div class=\"j-content txt--left pt--0 desktop-xl-pt--60\" data-block=\"\" data-type=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"text\">\n          <p><strong>Voskes' coveted cat soups? These are really ideal for furry friends who don't drink enough.</strong> This is because cats on a menu of mainly dry food are particularly prone to urolith formation (bladder stones), as they do not absorb enough fluids. For that reason, our tasty drinks encourage your cat to drink more, thanks to the delicious taste of broth with fine pieces of fish and meat.</p>\n\n                </div>\n    </div>\n        </div>\n          </div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-31\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--transparent title-c--nero link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-2\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-zonder_toegevoegd_zout1-images-38-31.png\" alt=\"HYDRATION... A MUST for cats\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-1\" data-options=\"extra-padding--tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h3>HYDRATION... A MUST!</h3><p>Cats generally don’t drink much. In the wild, they get a lot of moisture through their prey animals, which consist of 65-75% water. The other thing is, your cat's tongue is not designed to drink a lot of water in one go. With its rough barbs, it actually makes it quite tricky for your four-footed friend.</p><p>Your cat will therefore need to be enticed to drink: a running water tap, an inviting puddle of rainwater, a deliciously flavoured drink... To provide your cat with sufficient fluids, not only wet food, but also our Soups are ideal in your little tiger's menu.</p><p>This is because if a cat doesn’t drink enough, it negatively affects the urinary tract, with an increased risk of bladder stones. So definitely encourage your furry friend to drink enough !</p></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-22\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--white title-c--nero link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/original/drinks_eng1-p.webp\" alt=\"Soupflavours of Voskes for your cat\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h3>EACH FLAVOUR IS ENRICHED WITH EXTRAS TO SUPPORT YOUR CAT'S DIFFERENT NEEDS</h3><ul><li><strong>Soup with tuna:</strong> healthy digestion through prebiotics</li><li><strong>Soup with salmon:</strong> supports healthy bones and joints</li><li><strong>Soup with chicken:</strong> promotes healthy intestinal flora</li><li><strong>Soup with beef:</strong> supports the immune system</li></ul><h3>TIP!</h3><p>You can place this cat soup in a drinking bowl next to food or pour it over dry kibble as a topping for extra flavour!</p><a href=\"/cat-treats/drinks.html\" class=\"btn mt--15 btn--nero btn--normal\">مشاهده محصولات</a></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-23\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--transparent title-c--cat-primary link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-2\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-kat_op_tak1-images-38-23.png\" alt=\"Benefits of our soups for cats\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-1\" data-options=\"extra-padding--tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h2>GOOD REASONS TO CHOOSE OUR DRINKS:</h2><ul><li><strong>Stimulates hydration</strong></li><li><strong>With delicious, fine pieces of fish or meat</strong></li><li><strong>Grain-, gluten- and soy-free</strong></li><li><strong>Without added salt</strong></li><li><strong>4 delicious flavours</strong></li><li><strong>Easy-to-open 50gr cans</strong></li><li><strong>Can be kept for at least 36 months and 2 days after opening in the fridge</strong></li></ul></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            </div>"
